The piclink is one of the most convenient  pic host tools;

1: Multi-image transmission platform support
Support multiple pic host platforms, such as SM.MS, imgur, Niutu, Tencent Cloud COS, Alibaba Cloud OSS, Qiniu Cloud, Amazon AWS, Qiniu Cloud, Github, Gitee, etc., and also support custom pic host, etc. , to meet almost all  pic host platforms on the market;

2: One upload to get the picture link
Support one-click uploading of pictures and convert them into the picture link format you need;

3. Support image link to QR code
Supports converting image links into QR codes for easier promotion;

4: Multi-device synchronization function
Support multi-device synchronization, no longer have to worry about data loss;

5: Support drag and drop image transfer
Support drag and drop pictures from albums to quickly transfer pictures;
